Pizza sale analysis –  all sql queries
1.	Kpi
A)Total revenue:
SELECT SUM(total_price) as Total_Revenue
   from pizza_sales;
 
   ans- 817860.05083847

B)Average order value:
      SELECT SUM(total_price) / count(distinct order_id) as avg_order_value	
      FROM pizza_sales;
Ans 38.3072623343546

c)Total pizza sold:
select pizza_size,sum(total_price) as total_sales ,round(sum(total_price) *100 / (select sum(total_price) from pizza_sales),2) as percentage_sales
from pizza_sales group by pizza_size
order by percentage_sales desc;
   ans- 49574

